note sha256-s1.om: REDUCED test unit for OM-2 compiler slice S1 (ledger L838). It is NOT the delivered
note unit om/sha256/sha256-om2.om and is never linked into the product.
note Kept from the delivered unit: the om2 line, the K and IV hex lines (the same lines, produced
note mechanically from fixtures/sha256-k.dec and sha256-iv.dec), and rotr-based Sigma/sigma with the
note same round and schedule formulas.
note Reduced: rolled loops instead of unroll (S2); the state in a uint array instead of layout shactx
note (S3); w a zeroed new array instead of fresh (S3); program mode reading stdin 64 bytes at a time
note and writing the hex digest instead of unsized views, out and export entries (S4).
om2

